    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like there's more to it than just \"bad luck\" or \"sensitive contributions.\" it feels less like a technical error and more like a reaction to my energy or something. like the algorithms can sense a certain vibration that doesn't fit the norm and they just... dampen it? does that sound crazy? it's like the system identifies people who don't vibrate at the same frequency as the crowd and just pushes them into a void.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
